### Handys payment · settlement demo
### App: ./gradlew :app-api:bootRun  →  http://localhost:8080
### Swagger: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
###
### 시나리오 A — 멱등 charge (TC-PAY-IDEM-01)
### 시나리오 B — EXPIRED 후 웹훅 → 불일치 큐 (TC-PAY-MISMATCH-01)
### 시나리오 C — 정산 멱등 (TC-STL-IDEM-01)
###
### IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client: 위에서부터 실행. {{reservationId}}는 A-1 응답에서 복사.

@base = http://localhost:8080

### ---------- A-1. Prepare (PG 없음) ----------
# @name createDirect
POST {{base}}/guest/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "demo-prop",
  "roomTypeOrUnitId": "demo-deluxe",
  "checkIn": "2026-10-10",
  "checkOut": "2026-10-12",
  "amountWon": 120000,
  "mode": "HOTEL_POOL"
}

### ---------- A-2. Charge ×5 (두 번째부터 AlreadySucceeded) ----------
@reservationId = {{createDirect.response.body.reservationId}}

POST {{base}}/guest/reservations/{{reservationId}}/charge

###

POST {{base}}/guest/reservations/{{reservationId}}/charge

###

POST {{base}}/guest/reservations/{{reservationId}}/charge

###

POST {{base}}/guest/reservations/{{reservationId}}/charge

###

POST {{base}}/guest/reservations/{{reservationId}}/charge

### ---------- B-1. 새 예약 후 강제 expire ----------
# @name createForMismatch
POST {{base}}/guest/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "demo-prop",
  "roomTypeOrUnitId": "demo-deluxe-b",
  "checkIn": "2026-10-15",
  "checkOut": "2026-10-16",
  "amountWon": 80000,
  "mode": "HOTEL_POOL"
}

###
@mismatchReservationId = {{createForMismatch.response.body.reservationId}}

POST {{base}}/admin/expire-payments

###
### B-2. (데모) expire job이 TTL 전이면 상태가 PENDING일 수 있음.
### IT는 EXPIRED로 강제 후 웹훅. 수동 확인 시 Swagger로 상태 확인하거나
### 아래 웹훅만 날려 보고 /admin/mismatches 를 본다.
### 확실한 재현은: ./gradlew :app-api:test --tests '*PaymentIdempotencyIT*MISMATCH*'

POST {{base}}/webhooks/mock-pg
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pgEventId": "evt_demo_late_1",
  "reservationId": "{{mismatchReservationId}}",
  "pgPaymentId": "pg_demo_late"
}

###

GET {{base}}/admin/mismatches

### ---------- C-1. charge 후 월 정산 2회 (동일 응답) ----------
# @name createForSettle
POST {{base}}/guest/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "demo-prop",
  "roomTypeOrUnitId": "demo-deluxe-c",
  "checkIn": "2026-09-20",
  "checkOut": "2026-09-22",
  "amountWon": 100000,
  "mode": "HOTEL_POOL"
}

###
@settleReservationId = {{createForSettle.response.body.reservationId}}

POST {{base}}/guest/reservations/{{settleReservationId}}/charge

###

POST {{base}}/admin/settlements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "demo-prop",
  "period": "2026-09"
}

###

POST {{base}}/admin/settlements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "demo-prop",
  "period": "2026-09"
}

### ---------- (선택) OTA payout Posted ----------
POST {{base}}/admin/payouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel": "ota_a",
  "channelPayoutId": "po_demo_1",
  "propertyId": "demo-prop",
  "amountWon": 50000,
  "reservationIds": []
}
